FEM (Free Energy Mixer)  | Per-channel free-energy read on a prior $p_t$: $o_{t,j}=g_{t,j}\left[(1-\lambda_{t,j})\sum\nolimits_i p_t(i)v_{i,j}+\lambda_{t,j}\frac{1}{\beta_{\max}}\log\sum\nolimits_i p_t(i)e^{\beta_{\max}v_{i,j}}\right]$  | Value-aware posterior read; plug-and-play on softmax/linear/SSM priors; preserves prior complexity  | Paper / Repo

